	src<<browse({"
<body bgcolor="#000000" text="#FFFFFF">
<font face="Tahoma">
<font color=silver style="font-size: 12pt">Game Rules</font>
<font style="font-size: 8pt"><br><br>
1. Respect the players and administrators. Follow the Golden Rule.<br>
	            a. First Offense- Warning<br>
	            b. Second Offense- 5 Minute Mute<br>
	            c. Third Offense- 10 Minute Mute<br>
	            d. Fourth Offense- Permanent Mute<br>
<br>
2. No GM disrespect - The team works hard for the players, abusing comments about a GM will be dealt with severely. Constructive criticism and verbal abuse are two different things.<br>
	            a. First Offense-Warning<br>
	            b. Second Offense- 5 Minute Mute<br>
	            c. Third Offense- 10 Minute Mute<br>
	            d. Fourth Offense- Permanent Mute/Ban depending on scenario.<br>
<br>
3. No racism, sexism, or any type of slur that can be deemed as offensive. Please realize that people cannot discern the tone or intent of text.<br>
	            a. First offense- 5 Minute Mute<br>
	            b. Second offense- 10 Minute Mute<br>
	            c. Third offense- Permanent mute/ban depending on scenario.<br>
<br>
4. Spamming is not acceptable. This includes excessive use of caps.<br>
	            a. First Offense- 2 Minute Mute<br>
	            b. Second Offense- 5 Minute Mute<br>
	            c. Third Offense- 10 Minute Mute<br>
	            d. Recurring Offenses are subject to a permanent mute, depending on scenario.<br>
<br>
5. Use standard size fonts. Don't make us take away your Guild or title.<br>
<br>
6. Do not spam kill (killing same player 3 times on a short period of time/or within 30 minutes)<br>
	            1. First Offense- 1 Hour of Jail time<br>
	            2. Second Offense- 6 Hours of Jail time<br>
	            3. Third Offense- 24 Hours of Jail time<br>
	            4. Fourth Offense- 2 Week Ban<br>
	            5. Fifth Offense- Permanent Ban<br>
<b>Note:</b> This is mostly in place to protect new/weaker players. Certain situations will be tolerated, others will not. For example, camping outside the safezone waiting for someone is not okay, but killing someone who repeatably comes after you is okay. In the end, admins have final say on what is and what isn't spam killing, but in general just use common sense.<br>
<br>
7. Do not use any 3rd party software or any in-game exploits which include intentional bug abuse. Players will actually be rewarded for finding game breaking bugs and reporting them. This rule is subject to multiple types of punishments, depending on the extent of the offense. Some punishments are but not limited to the following:<br>
	            1. Boot and save wipe<br>
	            2. Temporary ban and save wipe<br>
	            3. Permanent ban<br>
<br>
8. Do not advertise/spam other games within this one. We will kindly ask you to leave and then deal with the situation accordingly.<br>
<br>
9. Do not equip items that hide your entire body, such as a turf icon. Making custom icons is a priviledge.<br>
<br>
10. OOC is not a place for adult rated content. This goes along with rule #3. Some cursing is okay.<br>
<br>
11. Use common sense, the other rules are in place and this rule is used by GMs to enforce them at their discretion. We aren't your parents, and we don't want to be. Behave like adults and you will have no problem.<br>
<br>
12. Have fun! Life is too short to not have fun.<br>
<a href=?src=\ref[usr];action=Main>Main Guide Menu</a>
"})


mob/Topic(href,href_list[])
	switch(href_list["action"])
		if("Whisper")
			var/message = input("What would you like to reply?","Whisper") as null|text
			if(!message)
				return
			if(usr.GMLevel >= 1)
				src << "<font color = #F819F5>(GM) <font color = blue><a href=?src=\ref[usr];action=Whisper>[usr.name]</a></font> Whispers: [message]"
				usr << "<font color = purple>To [src.name]: [message]"
			else
				if(src.gooc_on)
					src << "<font color = #F819F5><font color = blue><a href=?src=\ref[usr];action=Whisper>[usr.name]</a></font> Whispers: [message]"
					usr << "<font color = purple>To [src.name]: [message]"
			for(var/mob/PC/M in player)
				if(M.hearall)
					M << "Hearall <font color = #F819F5>(GM) <font color = blue><a href=?src=\ref[src];action=Whisper>[usr.name]</a></font> Whispered back: [message]"
		if("Main")
			usr.mainfile()
		if("Guide")
			usr.guidefile()
		if("FAQ")
			usr.faqfile()
		if("ECs")
			usr.ecsfile()
		if("Mobs")
			usr.mobsfile()
		if("Ranks")
			usr.ranksfile()
		if("TransFile")
			usr.transfile()
		if("TechFile")
			usr.techsfile()
		if("Rules")
			usr.rulesfile()
	.=..()
